"seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"6946","synopsis":"Dahlia Academy is a boarding school where the students come from two enemy countries: the Eastern Nation of Touwa, and the Principality of West. However, Romio Inuzuka, the first-year leader of the Touwa students, has always been in love with Juliet Persia, the first-year leader of the enemy West students. One day, Inuzuka decides to make his move and tell Juliet how he feels.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AnynQTx0BxLLHht9YTQecOXky8L.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"Dahlia Academy is a boarding school where the students come from two enemy countries: the Eastern Nation of Touwa, and the Principality of West. However, Romio Inuzuka, the first-year leader of the Touwa students, has always been in love with Juliet Persia, the first-year leader of the enemy West students. One day, Inuzuka decides to make his move and tell Juliet how he feels.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AnynQTx0BxLLHht9YTQecOXky8L.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13911","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101310","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37475","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82823","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"350555","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"7285","synopsis":"Another day, another confrontation between Touwa's Black Doggy House and the West's White Cats House. All the while, Inuzuka and Persia continue their secret romance. Then, the day of the tri-monthly outing to the town of Dahlia arrives. Inuzuka concocts a plan for a date with Persia. He disguises her in a Black Doggy boy's uniform. Things get spicy as they try to keep their date on the rails.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g6R42fTWgq6n1CKgnmb86E3LGIv.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Another day, another confrontation between Touwa's Black Doggy House and the West's White Cats House. All the while, Inuzuka and Persia continue their secret romance. Then, the day of the tri-monthly outing to the town of Dahlia arrives. Inuzuka concocts a plan for a date with Persia. He disguises her in a Black Doggy boy's uniform. Things get spicy as they try to keep their date on the rails.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g6R42fTWgq6n1CKgnmb86E3LGIv.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13911","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101310","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37475","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82823","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"350555","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"7326","synopsis":"It's Inuzuka and Persia's celebratory one month anniversary. The campus is abuzz due to the return of a certain student. Her name, the first princess of the West, \"Chartreux Westia\". Char walks the red carpet with composure as the White Cats laud her arrival. Inuzuka, tasked with opposing Char, is struck by her words. \"You're dating Persia, right?\" Has their love already been discovered?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9hDeHhe3frOdF18zcwHHpCThVrV.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"It's Inuzuka and Persia's celebratory one month anniversary. The campus is abuzz due to the return of a certain student. Her name, the first princess of the West, \"Chartreux Westia\". Char walks the red carpet with composure as the White Cats laud her arrival. Inuzuka, tasked with opposing Char, is struck by her words. \"You're dating Persia, right?\" Has their love already been discovered?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9hDeHhe3frOdF18zcwHHpCThVrV.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13911","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101310","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37475","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82823","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"350555","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"7356","synopsis":"The Black Doggies have begun their training camp in preparation for midterms. Persia dons her \"Julio\" disguise and participates at Inuzuka's request. In charge of the camp is Inuzuka's childhood friend, Hasuki Komai. Inuzuka learns by chance that he's the reason Hasuki is so dedicated. Guilty about keeping his relationship with Persia hidden from Hasuki, Inuzuka gathers his courage.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oYFewvsnrKcv7ZKtSIAtGSXBoJZ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"The Black Doggies have begun their training camp in preparation for midterms. Persia dons her \"Julio\" disguise and participates at Inuzuka's request. In charge of the camp is Inuzuka's childhood friend, Hasuki Komai. Inuzuka learns by chance that he's the reason Hasuki is so dedicated. Guilty about keeping his relationship with Persia hidden from Hasuki, Inuzuka gathers his courage.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oYFewvsnrKcv7ZKtSIAtGSXBoJZ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13911","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101310","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37475","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82823","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"350555","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"7381","synopsis":"The Dahlia campus is even more lively than usual with students training tirelessly for the upcoming sports festival. Aby Ssinia, a White Cats boy, and the girl after his heart, Somali Longhaired, appear before an obstinate Inuzuka. Aby aims to be a prefect, and in an effort to solidify his popularity among the White Cats, he approaches Persia. Inuzuka, unable to contain himself, speaks out.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cVJs6GnTYpiQkcN8RNrgdcEouqg.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"The Dahlia campus is even more lively than usual with students training tirelessly for the upcoming sports festival. Aby Ssinia, a White Cats boy, and the girl after his heart, Somali Longhaired, appear before an obstinate Inuzuka. Aby aims to be a prefect, and in an effort to solidify his popularity among the White Cats, he approaches Persia. Inuzuka, unable to contain himself, speaks out.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cVJs6GnTYpiQkcN8RNrgdcEouqg.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13911","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101310","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37475","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82823","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"350555","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"7542","synopsis":"Contenders for 'MVP' set their fighting spirits alight as the sports festival begins. Among them is a determined Inuzuka, now having been promised by Persia that she will entertain one request of his if he becomes MVP. The games progress with neither the Black Doggies nor the White Cats giving an inch, until finally the 7th event, 'Stick Down', is upon them. That's when the trouble begins.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8r06GcxnulG9MD4GPZ2CpYzedgu.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Contenders for 'MVP' set their fighting spirits alight as the sports festival begins. Among them is a determined Inuzuka, now having been promised by Persia that she will entertain one request of his if he becomes MVP. The games progress with neither the Black Doggies nor the White Cats giving an inch, until finally the 7th event, 'Stick Down', is upon them. That's when the trouble begins.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8r06GcxnulG9MD4GPZ2CpYzedgu.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13911","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101310","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37475","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82823","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"350555","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"7743","synopsis":"The sports festival's finale, 'Cavalry Battle' is where Inuzuka and Aby face off to settle things. Due to Inuzuka's provocations, an unprecedented overtime takes place. Inuzuka sympathizes with Persia, who wants to end the festival without a conclusion. However, a match is a match. Out of respect for each others' feelings, they just can't let it go. The all-out battle leads to shocking results.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gx6EmHJNkkblEk6HGNFRfLH7ZlI.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"The sports festival's finale, 'Cavalry Battle' is where Inuzuka and Aby face off to settle things. Due to Inuzuka's provocations, an unprecedented overtime takes place. Inuzuka sympathizes with Persia, who wants to end the festival without a conclusion. However, a match is a match. Out of respect for each others' feelings, they just can't let it go. The all-out battle leads to shocking results.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gx6EmHJNkkblEk6HGNFRfLH7ZlI.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13911","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101310","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37475","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82823","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"350555","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"7887","synopsis":"Inuzuka asks Persia on another date, this time to the Harvest Festival at a lake near campus. Not long after, the twin sisters 'Kochou Wang' and 'Teria Wang' appear before him. They may look immature, but the two 14 year old Black Doggy House prefects are prodigies that skipped to the second year of high school. Can Inuzuka have a normal date with Persia while these two watch his every move?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2Ut49iZ8fRS6QPD4XW3T0hIUWaG.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Inuzuka asks Persia on another date, this time to the Harvest Festival at a lake near campus. Not long after, the twin sisters 'Kochou Wang' and 'Teria Wang' appear before him. They may look immature, but the two 14 year old Black Doggy House prefects are prodigies that skipped to the second year of high school. Can Inuzuka have a normal date with Persia while these two watch his every move?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2Ut49iZ8fRS6QPD4XW3T0hIUWaG.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"e